  "details": "When previewing drone models in the inventory, the default drone is not appearing in the correct place, or at the correct scale.\n\nThe \"avatar testing chamber\" is a good world to see this, as the default drone preview seems to render on the platform in the center.\n\nRepro: \n\n1. Open your inventory\n\n2. Go to cosmetics\n\n3. Select a drone skin.\n\n4. Go back and forth between that skin and the default drone.\n\n5. See the default drone renders incorrectly.\n\nAttachments:\n\nVideo of this happening in game.",
